programme: WHILE CHARS WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 13.
##
## minus_unaire_possible -> CHARS . [ THEN SEMICOLON RPAREN RCROCHET ORDRE MULTIPLICATIF MINUS MANY_TIMES EGALE DO COMA ADDITIF ]
