##
## expression -> expression . ADDITIF expression [ ORDRE MULTIPLICATIF MINUS EGALE ADDITIF ]
## expression -> expression . MINUS expression [ ORDRE MULTIPLICATIF MINUS EGALE ADDITIF ]
## expression -> expression . MULTIPLICATIF expression [ ORDRE MULTIPLICATIF MINUS EGALE ADDITIF ]
## expression -> expression . ORDRE expression [ ORDRE MULTIPLICATIF MINUS EGALE ADDITIF ]
## instruction -> CHARS POINT expression . EGALE expression [ SEMICOLON ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## CHARS POINT expression
##

on attend "=" apres l'index, ou un opérateur

programme: CHARS POINT CHARS EGALE WHILE
##
## Ends in an error in state: 76.
##
## instruction -> CHARS POINT expression EGALE . expression [ SEMICOLON ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## CHARS POINT expression EGALE
##

on attend une expression apres "=" pour la valeur a affecter

programme: CHARS POINT CHARS EGALE COLOR WHILE
##
